# rpi_kubernetes governance (always on)

Use this repository for cluster bootstrap, Kubernetes platform services, and
infrastructure operations.

## Canonical docs

- `README.md`
- `docs/index.md`
- `docs/setup-guide.md`
- `docs/operations/kubernetes-deploy.md`
- `AGENTS.md`

## Hard boundaries

1. `management/backend` and `management/frontend` are deprecated surfaces.
   Do not add new feature work there.
2. New AQP control-plane and operator UI features belong in
   `agentic_quant_platform`.
3. Do not document `kubectl apply -k kubernetes/` as universally sufficient
   when CRD/operator install order is required.
4. Incident-specific notes belong under `docs/archive/`, not as canonical
   top-level docs.
5. Keep path references real and current; remove links to missing files.
